package pfsense // import "github.com/EvilBit-Labs/opnDossier/pkg/schema/pfsense"

Package pfsense defines the XML schema types for pfSense configuration files.

Package pfsense defines the XML schema types for pfSense configuration files.

Package pfsense defines the XML schema types for pfSense configuration files.

This package heavily reuses types from
github.com/EvilBit-Labs/opnDossier/pkg/schema/opnsense and only forks types
where the pfSense XML structure differs from OPNsense. The most common reason
for forking is pfSense's use of presence-based <enable/> elements (represented
as opnsense.BoolFlag) where OPNsense uses plain strings.

Forked types that contain BoolFlag fields require a custom MarshalXML method and
a private type alias (e.g., interfaceAlias) to ensure correct XML serialization.
See the BoolFlag addressability pattern documented in GOTCHAS.md section 15.

Package pfsense defines the XML schema types for pfSense configuration files.

Package pfsense defines the XML schema types for pfSense configuration files.

