func (p IPsecPhase1) MarshalXML(e *xml.Encoder, start xml.StartElement) error
    MarshalXML implements custom XML marshaling for IPsecPhase1,
    ensuring that the Disabled and Mobile BoolFlag fields are addressable so
    (*BoolFlag).MarshalXML is invoked. Without this, direct xml.Marshal calls
    on IPsecPhase1 values would fall back to default bool serialization instead
    of producing pfSense-compatible presence elements. Uses a value receiver so
    both value and pointer marshaling work correctly.

type IPsecPhase1Encryption struct {
	Algorithms []IPsecEncryptionAlgorithm `xml:"encryption-algorithm-option,omitempty" json:"algorithms,omitempty" yaml:"algorithms,omitempty"`
}
    IPsecPhase1Encryption wraps the <encryption> sub-element containing
    algorithm options for Phase 1. Each algorithm option specifies a cipher name
    and optional key length.

